an class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ビ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そな.える・そな.わる・つぶさ.に</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">準備</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅんび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">准备</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">設備</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せつび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">设备；设施；装置；配套设施；便利设施</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">備える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そなえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">配备；装备；提供；安装；为……做准备；筹备；预备；具有；具备；拥有；天生具有；与生俱来；先天拥有</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">宅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>家；住宅；住所；我家；我丈夫</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お宅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おたく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">你的家；你的住处；你的家族；你的丈夫；你的机构；贵机构；你</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">宅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">住宅；房子；家；自己的住宅；自己的家；丈夫</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">帰宅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きたく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">回家；返回家中；到家</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">害</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>伤害；损害；危害</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">害</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">がい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">伤害；损害；恶劣影响；危害</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">障害</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">障碍；阻碍；妨碍；困难；障碍；缺陷；残疾；功能障碍；障碍赛马；障碍赛跑；障碍赛（田径）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">損害</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そんがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">损害</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">配</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>分配；配偶；配给；流放</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くば.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">心配</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんぱい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">担心；忧虑；焦虑；不安；恐惧；关心；照料；帮助；援助；协助</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">支配</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しはい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">统治；支配；控制；指挥；管理；指导；控制；支配；影响；左右；（语法）支配；格支配</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">配達</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいたつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">配送；递送；投递</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">警</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>警察；警戒；警告；告诫</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いまし.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">警官</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">警察；警员；巡警</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">警察</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">警察；警官；警察人员；警察局；派出所；（接名词后）自封的