</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">援助；帮助；支持</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">救助</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">救济；救援；救助</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">助手</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょしゅ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">助手；助理；（教授的）助手；研究助手</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">労</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>劳动；疲劳；犒劳；感谢；辛苦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ろう.する・いたわ.る・いた.ずき・ねぎら・つか.れる・ねぎら.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦労</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くろう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劳苦；辛苦；困难；辛劳；忧虑；担心；焦虑；挂虑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">労働</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劳动；劳力；工作；工党</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">労る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いたわる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怜悯；同情；体谅；安慰；善待；体贴；照顾；护理；看护；安抚；慰劳；犒劳；酬劳（他人的辛劳）；认可（他人的努力）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">例</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>例子；习惯；用法；先例</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">レイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たと.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">例えば</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たとえば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">例如；比如；譬如</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">例</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ためし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">先例；例子</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">実例</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じつれい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">实例；例证；先例</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">然</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>那样；如此；既然如此；那么；（表示状态）样子</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゼン・ネン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しか・しか.り・しか.し・さ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偶然</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぐうぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">巧合；偶然；意外；偶然性；偶然地；出乎意料地；无意中；（哲学）偶然性（与必然性相对）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">自然</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自然；自然的；自发的；自动的；自然地；自发地；自动地</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">天然</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てんねん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自然；天然性；天然呆</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">限</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>限制；限度；限于；极限；尽量</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かぎ.る・かぎ.り・-かぎ.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">限る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かぎる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">限制；限定；局限；仅限于；只限于；局限于；最好是；最佳选择；唯一途径</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">限界</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げんかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">极限；界限；限度</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">制限</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいげん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">限制；约束；限定</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">追</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>追赶；追求；驱赶；补充；随后</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ツイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">追う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">追赶；追逐；追捕；跟随；遵循；顺应；跟随；驱赶；赶出；驱逐；驱赶（牲畜等）；（用被动形）被（时间等）逼迫；疲于应付</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">追い付く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おいつく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赶上；跟上；与…并驾齐驱；到达；得到补偿；弥补损失</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">追加</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ついか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">添加；补充；附加；附录</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">商</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>买卖；经商；商人</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あきな.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">商人</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうにん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">商人；商贩；店主；经营者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">商売</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贸易；商业；买卖；职业；行业；工作</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">商品</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうひん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">商品；货物；商品物资；库存品；商业物品</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">葉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>叶子；薄片状物；叶片；针叶；碎片</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">は</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">言葉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ことば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">语言；方言；词；短语；表达；术语；言语；说话方式；语言运用；话语；言辞；陈述；评论；学语；语言习得</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">葉書</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はがき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">明信片；便签；便条；卡片</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">葉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">は</span><span class=\"k-wz\">叶；叶片；（松树的）针叶；叶状体；叶丛</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">働</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>工作；劳动</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はたら.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">働く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はたらく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工作；劳动；起作用；运转；有效；奏效；犯（罪）；实施；做；行动；从事；被变位；被活用</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">働き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はたらき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劳动；工作；成绩；表现；能力；才能；工资；收入；薪水；动作；活动；作用；功能；运作；运动；动向；词形变化；屈折</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">労働</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劳动；劳力；工作；工党</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">形</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>形状；形态；样式；形式</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ・ギョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かた・-がた・かたち・なり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">形</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">形状；外形；身形；容貌；五官；相貌；仪表；体态；形式；样式；外表；表面上的样子；状态；局面；情况；形式；态度；举止；待人方式；礼仪；（围棋）棋形</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">人形</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にんぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">玩偶；木偶；提线木偶；傀儡；傀儡人物</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">形式</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">形式（相对于实质）；格式；形式；风格；方式；形式；礼节；（哲学）样态；形式；型（双线性型、二次型等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">景</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>风景；景色；景观</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">景色</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">景色；风景；景观</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">景気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">经济形势；市场；经济活动；经济气候；经济繁荣；景气；繁华；兴旺；生气；活力；朝气；精力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">光景</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">景象；景色；光景；景观</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">落</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>落下；掉落；降低；村落</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ラク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.ちる・お.ち・お.とす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">落す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おとす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">掉落；遗失；放下；投射；倒入；留下；擦净；去除（污垢、妆容等）；失去；（在某处）花钱；省略；遗漏；暗中放走；输掉（比赛）；淘汰（应试者）；使不及格；（选举中）击败对手；降低；减少；恶化；贬低；看不起；陷入困境；陷入（困境、罪孽）；据为己有；中标；迫使投降；攻陷（敌阵、城池）；强行说服；逼供；处理；下载；复制；使其失去意识（柔道）；讲完；说出关键部分；结束（斋戒等一段时期）；赢得；引诱；克服</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">落ちる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おちる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">落下；坠落；下降；倒塌；塌陷；崩塌；（日月）西沉；落下；下沉；（知名度、质量、速度、销售等）下降；衰落；下跌；衰退；恶化；减弱；不如；不及；逊于；差于；（污垢、油漆、妆等）脱落；（污渍）消除；（颜色）褪去；（疾病、附身等）消除；（多余脂肪）减掉；变瘦；变精瘦；遗漏；省略；缺失；（考试）不及格；（竞赛、选举等）落选；失败；（道德、品格等）堕落；变得低俗；沦落；堕入；没落；垮掉；毁灭；堕入（地狱）；陷入（爱河、睡眠等）；落入（某人手中）；（出价）被接受；（招标）中标；（汇票）被兑现；落入（陷阱）；上（当）；屈服；让步；认罪；招供；坦白；（最终）归结到（结论、话题等）；落在……上；弃守；逃离（城镇、城堡等）；战败逃亡；（话）听进去；心里接受；领会；陷落；战败；（金钱）进账；（光线、影子、目光等）落在……上；照到；投在；（柔道）被绞昏；失去知觉；昏迷；（网站、服务器等）宕机；崩溃；（网络游戏、聊天室等）登出；退出；离线；（鱼在冬天）游向深水；（动物）死亡；（闪电）击中</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">洒落</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゃらく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">洒脱；开朗；坦率；不拘束；随和</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">好</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>喜欢；爱好；良好；合适</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">この.む・す.く・よ.い・い.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">好き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喜欢</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">大好き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だいすき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">非常喜欢；热爱；很喜欢；非常爱好</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">好み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">このみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喜好；爱好；品味；偏好；心愿；愿望；选择；偏好</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">退</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>后退；撤退；退出；辞去；排斥</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しりぞ.く・しりぞ.ける・ひ.く・の.く・の.ける・ど.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">退院</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出院</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">引退</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いんたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">退休；隐退；退出</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">退屈</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいくつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">乏味；无聊；沉闷；单调；令人厌烦；感到厌倦；厌烦；厌倦</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">頭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>头；头部；（动物）头数；首领；顶端</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ・ズ・ト</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あたま・かしら・-がしら・かぶり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頭</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あたま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头；头部；头发；头脑；思维；智力；领导；首领；头目；队长；顶端；顶部；尖端；开始；起始；人头；人；首付；预付款；定金；汉字的上部部件；（麻将）雀头；将牌</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頭痛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ずつう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头痛</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頭脳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ずのう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头脑；大脑；智力；理解力；聪慧</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">負</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>败；负（承担）；欠（债）；负（责任）；减（负数）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ま.ける・ま.かす・お.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">負ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">失败；被击败；被打败；屈服；让步；退缩；投降；被压倒；不如；次于；被...比下去；长疹子；出疹；降价；打折；额外赠送</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">負け</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">失败；败北；输；辜负；有负；折扣；亏本</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勝負</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">胜负；胜败；比赛；竞赛；对决；较量</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">渡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>渡过；交给；转让；渡口；迁徙</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ト</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わた.る・-わた.る・わた.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">渡す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わたす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">摆渡过河；载运过河；架设；搭建；跨越；交付；交出；递交；传递；转移</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">渡る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わたる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">渡过；跨越；穿过；延伸；覆盖；跨越；贯穿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">橋渡し</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はしわたし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">调停；斡旋；中介；调解人；桥梁；架桥；搭桥</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">失</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>失去；丢失；损失；过错；失误</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うしな.う・う.せる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">失敗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しっぱい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">失败；错误；失误</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">失う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うしなう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">失去；丧失；错失；错过；痛失（亲人）；丧失（所爱之人）；丢（球、分）；失球；失分</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">失業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しつぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">失业；失业；失去工作</span></li></ul></div></li>"]